// Package prompts tests — T-13 characterization (Phase 1).
//
// THE LAW (roadmap Phase 1 + task list standing orders): the Python
// characterization tests are ported FIRST, then the code; the goldens were
// GENERATED by running the unmodified Python reference app
// (assadigit/GitCurator @ 98f4fc7) via testdiff/goldens/dump_prompts.py —
// never hand-typed. Regenerate with:
//
//	python3 testdiff/goldens/dump_prompts.py
//
// Ported suite: app/tests/test_phase2.py TestPrompts (all 6 tests, the
// loader refusal laws). The golden corpus additionally pins the {{SLOT}}
// grammar, every refusal message byte-exact, non-string slot values via
// Python str() semantics, the BOM quirk (plain UTF-8 read — a BOM would
// corrupt slot 1; the shipped files are asserted BOM-free), Python repr()
// for the {x!r} error shapes, and the ntpath basename grammar (the
// production platform's separator rules; see TestGoldenNtBasename).
